<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDEN BEAT SWITZERLAND 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN BEAT SWITZERLAND 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LULEA, SWEDEN 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden beat Switzerland 4-1</p>
<p>in their Davis Cup tennis World Group, first round tie after</p>
<p>winning both reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Thomas Enqvist beat Marc Rosset 6-3 6-2 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson beat Ivo Heuberger 3-6 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
